                    <span class="step__index">02</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="step__top">
                            <h3>Unpack</h3>
                            <span class="chip chip--accent">available</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Expand 7z, asar, NSIS and PyInstaller containers, or decode a zlib, gzip or raw DEFLATE stream in place.</p>
