                </li>
                <li class="step">
                    <span class="step__index">03</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="step__top">
                            <h3>Decode</h3>
                            <span class="chip chip--accent">available</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Map an address onto its file offset, disassemble x86/x64 or CPython bytecode, then carve regions and diff two builds.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="step">
                    <span class="step__index">04</span>
                    <div>
                        <div class="step__top">
                            <h3>Verify</h3>
                            <span class="chip chip--accent">available</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Patch bytes atomically and compare the whole-file hash before and after the change.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ol>
            <p class="loop__note">There is no pseudo-code, no debugger and no signature validation in this loop.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="band">
